# Pavion RTS - GitHub Linguist Language & Attribute Definitions

# Documentation
docs/* linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation

# Generated & Build Artifacts
client/dist/* linguist-vendored
server/dist/* linguist-vendored
node_modules/* linguist-vendored
.system_generated/* linguist-vendored

# Explicit Language Classifications
services/ai-engine/*.py linguist-language=Python
database/*.sql linguist-language=SQL
server/prisma/migrations_postgresql/*.sql linguist-language=SQL
scripts/*.sh linguist-language=Shell
Dockerfile linguist-language=Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml linguist-language=YAML
.github/workflows/*.yml linguist-language=YAML
